        <userTask name="Perform repair (standard level)" id="bpmn-000b2026-7be0-494a-891a-b52df9ceebf0">
            <documentation textFormat="text/html">Standard service level is common for most customer support.&lt;br&gt;This level guarantees the fridge will be repaired in a reasonable amount of time.&lt;br&gt;Customers may decide to raise the service level to Premium while waiting for the standard service to solve the issue.</documentation>
        </userTask>
